OL,3,GNEWSAMan once 'isolated' by disorder
OL,4,Acreates food guide
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who used to feel "isolated" due
OL,7,Fto his autoimmune disorder has found a
OL,8,Fnew sense of freedom after making his
OL,9,Fown restaurant guide.
OL,11,FTony Barfoot was diagnosed with coeliac
OL,12,Fdisease at the age of 55. The
OL,13,Fcondition, which sees his immune system
OL,14,Fattack its own tissues whenever gluten
OL,15,Fis ingested, and can develop at any
OL,16,Fage.
OL,18,FBarfoot said after his diagnosis, he
OL,19,Ffound eating out "incredibly hard" as
OL,20,Fone restaurant refused to cater for
OL,21,Fhim, which felt isolating.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
