OL,3,GNEWSAMan once 'isolated' by disorder
OL,4,Acreates food guide
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut after years of avoiding eating out,
OL,7,Fhe decided to create his own 'Salisbury
OL,8,FGluten Free Guide' to map out safe
OL,9,Frestaurants, where risk of
OL,10,Fcross-contamination is low.
